    "detailed_description": "<h1>Groups</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CS: <a href=\"mailto:huoyanzhengcheng@gmail.com\">huoyanzhengcheng@gmail.com</a></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck Building</strong>: Construct your own unique deck freely to create a personalized battle style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Combat</strong>: Engage in deep tactical battles and savor the thrill of intellectual challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Collaboration</strong>: Connect with like-minded allies and showcase the power of teamwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Matches</strong>: Each battle is quick and engaging, perfect for enjoying combat in your spare time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Trading</strong>: Trade unique cards freely, fully embracing the joy of collection</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Class Overview</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mage</strong>: Devoted to studying magical energies, skilled in dealing area damage and controlling enemy troops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Priest</strong>: A devoted follower who employs powerful healing and defensive spells to protect allies, while invoking the Holy Light to burn enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranger</strong>: With keen instincts and agile movements, capable of inflicting direct damage on enemy heroes, while their card control skills pose a significant threat to foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warrior</strong>: The embodiment of strength, courage, and conviction, enhancing the attack capabilities of allies while delivering direct damage to enemies with various skills</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck Building</strong>: Construct your own unique deck freely to create a personalized battle style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Combat</strong>: Engage in deep tactical battles and savor the thrill of intellectual challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Collaboration</strong>: Connect with like-minded allies and showcase the power of teamwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Matches</strong>: Each battle is quick and engaging, perfect for enjoying combat in your spare time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Trading</strong>: Trade unique cards freely, fully embracing the joy of collection</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Class Overview</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mage</strong>: Devoted to studying magical energies, skilled in dealing area damage and controlling enemy troops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Priest</strong>: A devoted follower who employs powerful healing and defensive spells to protect allies, while invoking the Holy Light to burn enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranger</strong>: With keen instincts and agile movements, capable of inflicting direct damage on enemy heroes, while their card control skills pose a significant threat to foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warrior</strong>: The embodiment of strength, courage, and conviction, enhancing the attack capabilities of allies while delivering direct damage to enemies with various skills</p></li></ul>",
